### 2.1 Understand the FSM Architecture First

The FSM you'll be diagnosing lives in [`model_util.py`](file:///c:/Users/varsh/My%20Projects/t-udeepsc/UDeepSC_FSM/model_util.py#L851-L881):

```
FSM Pipeline (per modality encoder):
  input_feature [B, N, D]
       │
  mask_gen (MLP network)
       │ outputs logits [B, N, 2] (keep/drop probabilities)
       │
  Gumbel-Softmax (hard=True during training)
       │ produces binary mask curr_m [B, N, 1]
       │
  (inference only) argsort by prob_kept → keep top-K
       │ K = round(mask_num × rho)
       │ rho = learned function of noise_std
       │
  batch_index_select → pruned feature set
```

