## Risk Register & Mitigations

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| Baseline doesn't reproduce paper metrics | Blocks everything | Use original authors' checkpoints if available; accept ±2% variance |
| XAI selector worse than black-box FSM | Weakens contribution | Phase 2 diagnosis provides fallback narrative ("we showed *why* it works, even if we can't beat it") |
| BERT weights too large / slow | Training time | Use `bert-small` (already specified in code), not `bert-base` |
| VQA/MSA datasets too large to download | Missing tasks | **Core contribution only needs CIFAR + SST.** VQA/MSA are bonus |
| ESP32 packet loss too unreliable | Hardware demo | Add software-injected corruption flag as reproducible fallback |
| MATLAB `pyenv` fails on your machine | Demo broken | Pre-record demo video as backup; test `pyenv` early |
| GPU OOM during training | Can't train | Reduce batch_size to 16 or 8; use gradient accumulation |

